le":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320208006:1":{"text":"对啊……克利夫，克利夫是谁来着……你们莫不是在找雪花珀蒂的丈夫吧？","source_cn":"对啊……克利夫，克利夫是谁来着……你们莫不是在找雪花珀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EF72342DFDE6472","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320208007:1":{"text":"应该是吧？我们认识的克利夫是一名猎人。","source_cn":"应该是吧？我们认识的克利夫是一名猎人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x546D2602CACF8C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320208008:1":{"text":"呵、呵，那应该就是了，克利夫的确是名猎人。","source_cn":"呵、呵，那应该就是了，克利夫的确是名猎人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76C24AC7E0556A71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320208009:1":{"text":"欸？为什么你讲话爷爷能听到？","source_cn":"欸？为什么你讲话爷爷能听到？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90FC27B0FC0DD5AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320208010:1":{"text":"我也不懂，可能我的声音更尖锐一些？","source_cn":"我也不懂，可能我的声音更尖锐一些？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0428810CBDC58BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320208011:1":{"text":"这个男人娶了我们村的珀蒂，说到珀蒂……当时村里所有的男人都喜欢她。","source_cn":"这个男人娶了我们村的珀蒂，说到珀蒂……当时村里所有的男...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x371A8E657E92C260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320208012:1":{"text":"她美的就像是雪花一样冰清玉洁，为人也温柔善良，不知道从什么时候起，大家就都叫她小雪花。","source_cn":"她美的就像是雪花一样冰清玉洁，为人也温柔善良，不知道从...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99F4D0A7D8B5A0D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320208013:1":{"text":"唉，谁知道她嫁给了那个外乡来的猎人，操着一口土掉渣的口音，呵呵，真是赖汉娶好妻。","source_cn":"唉，谁知道她嫁给了那个外乡来的猎人，操着一口土掉渣的口...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4EAC956D8125D3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320208014:1":{"text":"呃……我们是来找珀蒂的，能麻烦您指下她家的方向吗？","source_cn":"呃……我们是来找珀蒂的，能麻烦您指下她家的方向吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77DC1AEE07792F11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320208015:1":{"text":"她家？哦……你是说要给她的墓地献花吗？","source_cn":"她家？哦……你是说要给她的墓地献花吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC3706BBFBD1594A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320208016:1":{"text":"什么？墓地？","source_cn":"什么？墓地？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D7DF0519DC793F4","variant_status":"","male":"","f